@startuml context-dfd
' DFD Level 0 - Context Diagram
title Hospital Home-Care System - Context Diagram (DFD Level 0)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "End User /\nRelative" as User
actor "Admin" as Admin
actor "OAuth Provider\n(Google etc.)" as OAuth
actor "Nurse / Caregiver" as Nurse

usecase "Hospital\nHome-Care System" as System

User --> System : Login, Book service,\nSpecial demands
System --> User : Service list, Booking status,\nConfirmation

OAuth --> System : Identity / token
System --> OAuth : Auth request

System --> Admin : Booking requests + demands
Admin --> System : Confirm booking,\nAssigned nurse info, Updates

Admin ..> Nurse : Coordinates offline\n(OUTSIDE SYSTEM)

@enduml
